{"timestamp":"07:10:08.818","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[useResolvedBaseline] findBaselineInLibrary result: {\"activitySpaces\":[{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Initiated\"}],\"description\":\"Explore the possibilities presented by the creation of a new or improved platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Explore Possibilities\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Determined\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Value Established\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Viable\"}],\"description\":\"Conduct rigorous business analysis to quantify potential ROI, map platform capabilities to organizational value streams, and secure executive sponsorship.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Assess Business Value\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Addressed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Benefit Accrued\"}],\"description\":\"Track KPIs such as deployment frequency, MTTR, and developer adoption rates to proactively manage bottlenecks and prove continuous ROI.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Monitor Value Realization\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"stateName\":\"Allocated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"stateName\":\"Sustained\"}],\"description\":\"Define chargeback/showback models, right-size infrastructure, optimize costs through FinOps practices, and transition from CapEx to OpEx.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Manage Platform Economics\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Represented\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Involved\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"In Agreement\"}],\"description\":\"Conduct user research, utilize Jobs-to-be-Done frameworks, and ensure the platform demonstrates value through product management practices.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Engage Platform Consumers\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Satisfied for Deployment\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Satisfied in Use\"}],\"description\":\"Provide internal marketing, create feedback loops, and deliver accessible support to ensure continuous voluntary adoption by stream-aligned teams.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Evangelize and Support\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"Leadership\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Assessed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Mitigated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Automated\"}],\"description\":\"Shift security left, embed Zero Trust principles, and codify compliance requirements into automated scanning tools to ensure secure-by-default platform operations.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Establish Secure Guardrails\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Bounded\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Coherent\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Acceptable\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Addressed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Fulfilled\"}],\"description\":\"Distill stakeholder feedback into actionable requirements and define the Thinnest Viable Platform (TVP) to avoid over-engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Define Platform Capabilities\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Analysis\",\"Platform Strategic Alignment\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Architecture Selected\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Baselined\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Provisioned\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Ready\"}],\"description\":\"Establish declarative provisioning (IaC), build CI/CD pipelines, configure connectivity, deploy orchestration engines, and instantiate the six pillars of platform engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Architect and Build the Foundation\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Hosting Assets\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Evolving\"}],\"description\":\"Execute Day-2 operations using SRE practices, manage observability telemetry, ensure high availability, and continuously evolve the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Operate and Evolve the System\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Site Reliability\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Scoped\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Available\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Self Service\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Optimized\"}],\"description\":\"Build Internal Developer Portals (IDPs), intuitive CLIs, and automated scaffolding templates to drastically reduce cognitive load and enable autonomous self-service.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Develop the Golden Paths\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Specified\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Provisioned\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Integrated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Operational\"}],\"description\":\"Specify, acquire, and securely integrate individual platform assets ensuring seamless interoperability with established Golden Paths.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Integrate Toolchain Services\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Site Reliability\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Prepared\"}],\"description\":\"Prepare to do the work required for the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Prepare To Do The Work\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\",\"Leadership\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Started\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Under Control\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Concluded\"}],\"description\":\"Manage agile delivery cycles, allocate engineering capacity, and track velocity to ensure predictable platform feature development.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Coordinate Delivery Sprints\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Formed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Collaborating\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Performing\"}],\"description\":\"Define clear team interaction modes, establish X-as-a-Service boundaries, and continuously assess cognitive load using Team Topologies principles.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Structure Organizational Topologies\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Leadership\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"Foundation Established\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"In Use\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"In Place\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"Working Well\"}],\"description\":\"Define incident response procedures, institute blameless post-mortems, standardize CI methodologies, and foster a continuous-learning culture.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Establish Operational Practices\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Site Reliability\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Governance\",\"stateName\":\"Documented\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Governance\",\"stateName\":\"Audited\"}],\"description\":\"Translate manual governance rules into automated, machine-readable policies that execute within deployment pipelines without impeding velocity.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Implement Policy-as-Code\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Strategized\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Enabled\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Embedded\"}],\"description\":\"Execute formal change management programs, upskill engineering talent, address behavioral resistance, and facilitate the shift to product-driven platform engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Drive Cultural Transformation\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Leadership\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Closed\"}],\"description\":\"Stop the work and close out the endeavor.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Stop The Work\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\"]}],\"alphas\":[{\"description\":\"The foundational business drivers dictating the platform transformation.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Opportunity\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The desire to adopt a platform is identified.\",\"name\":\"Initiated\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The value and parameters of the platform are quantified.\",\"name\":\"Determined\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform's value is accepted by sponsors.\",\"name\":\"Value Established\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The business case demonstrates a viable return.\",\"name\":\"Viable\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The 