{"timestamp":"07:10:45.192","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[extractPracticeNames] result: {\"activityNamesBySpace\":{},\"activitySpaceNames\":[\"Architect and Build the Foundation\",\"Assess Business Value\",\"Coordinate Delivery Sprints\",\"Define Platform Capabilities\",\"Develop the Golden Paths\",\"Drive Cultural Transformation\",\"Engage Platform Consumers\",\"Establish Operational Practices\",\"Establish Secure Guardrails\",\"Evangelize and Support\",\"Explore Possibilities\",\"Implement Policy-as-Code\",\"Integrate Toolchain Services\",\"Manage Platform Economics\",\"Monitor Value Realization\",\"Operate and Evolve the System\",\"Prepare To Do The Work\",\"Stop The Work\",\"Structure Organizational Topologies\"],\"alphaNames\":[\"Opportunity\",\"Organizational Change\",\"Platform\",\"Platform Asset\",\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"Platform Governance\",\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"Requirements\",\"Stakeholders\",\"Team\",\"Way Of Working\",\"Work\"],\"competencyLevelNamesByCompetency\":{},\"competencyNames\":[\"Analysis\",\"Engineering\",\"Leadership\",\"Management\",\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Site Reliability\",\"Stakeholder Representation\"],\"levelOfDetailNamesByWorkProduct\":{},\"narrativeElementNamesByType\":{},\"narrativeTypeNames\":[\"Citation Standard\",\"Epic\",\"Essay Narrative\",\"Lifecycle\",\"Micro-Narratives (ABT)\",\"Report Narrative\",\"The Hero's Journey\",\"The STAR Format\",\"The Three-Act Structure & StoryBrand\",\"User story\"],\"patternNames\":[\"AAP 2.6 Enterprise Adoption Lifecycle\"],\"personaGroupNames\":[],\"personaNames\":[],\"stateNamesByAlpha\":{},\"workProductNames\":[]}"}
{"timestamp":"07:10:45.925","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[extractPracticeNames] currentDoc: {\"activities\":[],\"activitySpaces\":[],\"alphas\":[],\"baselinePracticeName\":\"Platform Adoption Essentials\",\"description\":\"This coordinating macro-practice orchestrates the entire Ansible Automation Platform 2.6 adoption lifecycle. It explicitly does not define new Alphas, Activities, or discrete Work Products. Instead, it establishes an overarching temporal framework—via comprehensive Patterns—that accurately tracks the simultaneous progression of architectural planning, containerized physical deployment, access governance, and mesh scaling across unified organizational delivery phases.\",\"name\":\"AAP 2.6 Lifecycle Orchestration Practice\",\"narratives\":[{\"description\":\"How the four disparate practices compose into a single unified lifecycle\",\"name\":\"Orchestration Overview\",\"narrativeContexts\":[{\"context\":\"Enterprise platform engineering simply cannot occur in isolated silos. High-level architecture must seamlessly inform infrastructure provisioning, which must be physically verified before complex governance policies and distributed mesh networks can be applied safely.\",\"narrativeElementName\":\"Prerequisites\",\"seq\":1},{\"context\":\"This Lifecycle pattern coordinates these distinct capability domains, ensuring that organizations achieve operational maturity sequentially and logically. For example, the Deployment Topology must reach the Baselined state before the Installation Configuration is permitted to enter the Executed state, explicitly preventing costly deployment rework. By observing the Pattern View Matrix, technology leaders can track the holistic health of the automation rollout, ensuring that security (RBAC) and scale (Mesh) mature in lockstep with the core infrastructure platform.\",\"narrativeElementName\":\"Lifecycle Phase\",\"seq\":2}],\"narrativeName\":\"The Complete Platform Adoption Journey\",\"narrativeTypeName\":\"Lifecycle\"}],\"patterns\":[{\"description\":\"The end-to-end orchestration of planning, installing, securing, and scaling the platform ecosystem.\",\"name\":\"AAP 2.6 Enterprise Adoption Lifecycle\",\"narrativeTypeName\":\"Lifecycle\",\"narratives\":[{\"description\":\"The sequential approach to deploying AAP 2.6 effectively.\",\"name\":\"Adoption Lifecycle Context\",\"narrativeContexts\":\"[Array]\",\"narrativeName\":\"Orchestrating the Entire Rollout\",\"narrativeTypeName\":\"Lifecycle\"}],\"patternViews\":[{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Securing enterprise subscriptions, evaluating basic workloads, and establishing a baseline understanding of capability needs.\",\"name\":\"Prerequisites Phase\",\"seq\":0},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Finalizing exhaustive system blueprints, provisioning the base RHEL host nodes, and finalizing the exact configurations to be injected.\",\"name\":\"Architecture and Preparation Phase\",\"seq\":1},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Executing the configuration-as-code installer playbooks and rigorously validating that core rootless container services are active.\",\"name\":\"Container Deployment Phase\",\"seq\":2},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Hardening access controls via the Gateway, integrating SSO, and deploying the initial layers of the automation mesh.\",\"name\":\"Governance and Day-2 Operations Phase\",\"seq\":3},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Reaching peak maturity by fully automating governance and verifying edge execution resilience.\",\"name\":\"Enterprise Scale Phase\",\"seq\":4}]}],\"personaGroups\":[],\"personas\":[],\"workProducts\":[]}"}
{"timestamp":"07:10:45.925","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[extractPracticeNames] baseline: {\"activitySpaces\":[{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Initiated\"}],\"description\":\"Explore the possibilities presented by the creation of a new or improved platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Explore Possibilities\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Determined\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Value Established\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Viable\"}],\"description\":\"Conduct rigorous business analysis to quantify potential ROI, map platform capabilities to organizational value streams, and secure executive sponsorship.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Assess Business Value\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Addressed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Benefit Accrued\"}],\"description\":\"Track KPIs such as deployment frequency, MTTR, and developer adoption rates to proactively manage bottlenecks and prove continuous ROI.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Monitor Value Realization\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"stateName\":\"Allocated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"stateName\":\"Sustained\"}],\"description\":\"Define chargeback/showback models, right-size infrastructure, optimize costs through FinOps practices, and transition from CapEx to OpEx.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Manage Platform Economics\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Represented\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Involved\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"In Agreement\"}],\"description\":\"Conduct user research, utilize Jobs-to-be-Done frameworks, and ensure the platform demonstrates value through product management practices.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Engage Platform Consumers\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Satisfied for Deployment\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Satisfied in Use\"}],\"description\":\"Provide internal marketing, create feedback loops, and deliver accessible support to ensure continuous voluntary adoption by stream-aligned teams.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Evangelize and Support\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"Leadership\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Assessed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Mitigated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Automated\"}],\"description\":\"Shift security left, embed Zero Trust principles, and codify compliance requirements into automated scanning tools to ensure secure-by-default platform operations.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Establish Secure Guardrails\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Bounded\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Coherent\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Acceptable\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Addressed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Fulfilled\"}],\"description\":\"Distill stakeholder feedback into actionable requirements and define the Thinnest Viable Platform (TVP) to avoid over-engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Define Platform Capabilities\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Analysis\",\"Platform Strategic Alignment\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Architecture Selected\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Baselined\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Provisioned\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Ready\"}],\"description\":\"Establish declarative provisioning (IaC), build CI/CD pipelines, configure connectivity, deploy orchestration engines, and instantiate the six pillars of platform engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Architect and Build the Foundation\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Hosting Assets\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Evolving\"}],\"description\":\"Execute Day-2 operations using SRE practices, manage observability telemetry, ensure high availability, and continuously evolve the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Operate and Evolve the System\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Site Reliability\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Scoped\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Available\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Self Service\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Optimized\"}],\"description\":\"Build Internal Developer Portals (IDPs), intuitive CLIs, and automated scaffolding templates to drastically reduce cognitive load and enable autonomous self-service.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Develop the Golden Paths\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Specified\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Provisioned\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Integrated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Operational\"}],\"description\":\"Specify, acquire, and securely integrate individual platform assets ensuring seamless interoperability with established Golden Paths.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Integrate Toolchain Services\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Site Reliability\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Prepared\"}],\"description\":\"Prepare to do the work required for the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Prepare To Do The Work\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\",\"Leadership\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Started\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Under Control\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Concluded\"}],\"description\":\"Manage agile delivery cycles, allocate engineering capacity, and track velocity to ensure predictable platform feature development.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Coordinate Delivery Sprints\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Formed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Collaborating\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Performing\"}],\"description\":\"Define clear team interaction modes, establish X-as-a-Service boundaries, and continuously assess cognitive load using Team Topologies principles.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Structure Organizational Topologies\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Leadership\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"Foundation Established\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"In Use\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"In Place\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"Working Well\"}],\"description\":\"Define incident response procedures, institute blameless post-mortems, standardize CI methodologies, and foster a continuous-learning culture.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Establish Operational Practices\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Site Reliability\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Governance\",\"stateName\":\"Documented\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Governance\",\"stateName\":\"Audited\"}],\"description\":\"Translate manual governance rules into automated, machine-readable policies that execute within deployment pipelines without impeding velocity.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Implement Policy-as-Code\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Strategized\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Enabled\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Embedded\"}],\"description\":\"Execute formal change management programs, upskill engineering talent, address behavioral resistance, and facilitate the shift to product-driven platform engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Drive Cultural Transformation\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Leadership\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Closed\"}],\"description\":\"Stop the work and close out the endeavor.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Stop The Work\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\"]}],\"alphas\":[{\"description\":\"The foundational business drivers dictating the platform transformation.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Opportunity\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The desire to adopt a platform is identified.\",\"name\":\"Initiated\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The value and parameters of the platform are quantified.\",\"name\":\"Determined\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform's value is accepted by sponsors.\",\"name\":\"Value Established\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The business case demonstrates a viable return.\",\"name\":\"Viable\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The opportunity is actively being addressed by the platform.\",\"name\":\"Addressed\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The expected benefits are being consistently realized.\",\"name\":\"Benefit Accrued\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The financial and outcome-based justification and accounting for the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Financial needs and potential values are recognized.\",\"name\":\"Modeled\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Costs and benefits are logically modeled.\",\"name\":\"Allocated\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The economic model is approved.\",\"name\":\"Sustained\",\"seq\":3}]},{\"description\":\"The individuals, groups, or organizations affected by, or able to affect, the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Stakeholders\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Key stakeholders are identified.\",\"name\":\"Recognized\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholder representatives are designated.\",\"name\":\"Represented\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders actively participate.\",\"name\":\"Involved\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholder expectations are aligned.\",\"name\":\"In Agreement\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders approve deployment.\",\"name\":\"Satisfied for Deployment\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders are satisfied with the operational platform.\",\"name\":\"Satisfied in Use\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The capabilities, features, and constraints the platform must satisfy.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Requirements\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The need for a specific asset is identified.\",\"name\":\"Conceived\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The scope of the requirements is defined.\",\"name\":\"Bounded\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Requirements are clear, consistent, and logical.\",\"name\":\"Coherent\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders agree the requirements meet their needs.\",\"name\":\"Acceptable\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform satisfies the established requirements.\",\"name\":\"Addressed\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"All requirements are successfully delivered and operational.\",\"name\":\"Fulfilled\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The unified system of assets and interfaces provided to consumers.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Platform\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The foundational structure is chosen.\",\"name\":\"Architecture Selected\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Core capabilities are established.\",\"name\":\"Baselined\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform can be consumed.\",\"name\":\"Provisioned\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform is fully operational.\",\"name\":\"Ready\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform is actively supporting workloads.\",\"name\":\"Hosting Assets\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform is decommissioned.\",\"name\":\"Evolving\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The means by which consumers interact with and consume platform assets.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The desired interface is conceptualized.\",\"name\":\"Envisioned\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Interface capabilities are defined.\",\"name\":\"Scoped\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The interface is accessible.\",\"name\":\"Available\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Consumers can independently use the interface.\",\"name\":\"Self Service\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The interface provides a frictionless experience.\",\"name\":\"Optimized\",\"seq\":5}]},{\"description\":\"The individual services, tools, or resources that constitute the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Platform Asset\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The need for a specific asset is identified.\",\"name\":\"Identified\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Asset requirements are detailed.\",\"name\":\"Specified\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset is created or acquired.\",\"name\":\"Provisioned\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset works within the broader platform.\",\"name\":\"Integrated\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset is in active use.\",\"name\":\"Operational\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset is decommissioned.\",\"name\":\"Value Yielding\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The activities required to build, operate, and maintain the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Work\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is requested.\",\"name\":\"Initiated\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is ready to begin.\",\"name\":\"Prepared\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is in progress.\",\"name\":\"Started\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is proceeding predictably.\",\"name\":\"Under Control\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is finished.\",\"name\":\"Concluded\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"All work activities are officially complete.\",\"name\":\"Closed\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The group of individuals responsible for the platform's success.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Team\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Initial team members are identified.\",\"name\":\"Seeded\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The team structure is established.\",\"name\":\"Formed\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":