ely being addressed by the platform.\",\"name\":\"Addressed\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The expected benefits are being consistently realized.\",\"name\":\"Benefit Accrued\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The financial and outcome-based justification and accounting for the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Financial needs and potential values are recognized.\",\"name\":\"Modeled\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Costs and benefits are logically modeled.\",\"name\":\"Allocated\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The economic model is approved.\",\"name\":\"Sustained\",\"seq\":3}]},{\"description\":\"The individuals, groups, or organizations affected by, or able to affect, the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Stakeholders\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Key stakeholders are identified.\",\"name\":\"Recognized\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholder representatives are designated.\",\"name\":\"Represented\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders actively participate.\",\"name\":\"Involved\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholder expectations are aligned.\",\"name\":\"In Agreement\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders approve deployment.\",\"name\":\"Satisfied for Deployment\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders are satisfied with the operational platform.\",\"name\":\"Satisfied in Use\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The capabilities, features, and constraints the platform must satisfy.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Requirements\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The need for a specific asset is identified.\",\"name\":\"Conceived\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The scope of the requirements is defined.\",\"name\":\"Bounded\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist