{"timestamp":"07:10:46.117","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[extractPracticeNames] result: {\"activityNamesBySpace\":{},\"activitySpaceNames\":[\"Architect and Build the Foundation\",\"Assess Business Value\",\"Coordinate Delivery Sprints\",\"Define Platform Capabilities\",\"Develop the Golden Paths\",\"Drive Cultural Transformation\",\"Engage Platform Consumers\",\"Establish Operational Practices\",\"Establish Secure Guardrails\",\"Evangelize and Support\",\"Explore Possibilities\",\"Implement Policy-as-Code\",\"Integrate Toolchain Services\",\"Manage Platform Economics\",\"Monitor Value Realization\",\"Operate and Evolve the System\",\"Prepare To Do The Work\",\"Stop The Work\",\"Structure Organizational Topologies\"],\"alphaNames\":[\"Opportunity\",\"Organizational Change\",\"Platform\",\"Platform Asset\",\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"Platform Governance\",\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"Requirements\",\"Stakeholders\",\"Team\",\"Way Of Working\",\"Work\"],\"competencyLevelNamesByCompetency\":{},\"competencyNames\":[\"Analysis\",\"Engineering\",\"Leadership\",\"Management\",\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Site Reliability\",\"Stakeholder Representation\"],\"levelOfDetailNamesByWorkProduct\":{},\"narrativeElementNamesByType\":{},\"narrativeTypeNames\":[\"Citation Standard\",\"Epic\",\"Essay Narrative\",\"Lifecycle\",\"Micro-Narratives (ABT)\",\"Report Narrative\",\"The Hero's Journey\",\"The STAR Format\",\"The Three-Act Structure & StoryBrand\",\"User story\"],\"patternNames\":[\"AAP 2.6 Enterprise Adoption Lifecycle\"],\"personaGroupNames\":[],\"personaNames\":[],\"stateNamesByAlpha\":{},\"workProductNames\":[]}"}
{"timestamp":"07:10:46.117","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[extractPracticeNames] currentDoc: {\"activities\":[],\"activitySpaces\":[],\"alphas\":[],\"baselinePracticeName\":\"Platform Adoption Essentials\",\"description\":\"This coordinating macro-practice orchestrates the entire Ansible Automation Platform 2.6 adoption lifecycle. It explicitly does not define new Alphas, Activities, or discrete Work Products. Instead, it establishes an overarching temporal framework—via comprehensive Patterns—that accurately tracks the simultaneous progression of architectural planning, containerized physical deployment, access governance, and mesh scaling across unified organizational delivery phases.\",\"name\":\"AAP 2.6 Lifecycle Orchestration Practice\",\"narratives\":[{\"description\":\"How the four disparate practices compose into a single unified lifecycle\",\"name\":\"Orchestration Overview\",\"narrativeContexts\":[{\"context\":\"Enterprise platform engineering simply cannot occur in isolated silos. High-level architecture must seamlessly inform infrastructure provisioning, which must be physically verified before complex governance policies and distributed mesh networks can be applied safely.\",\"narrativeElementName\":\"Prerequisites\",\"seq\":1},{\"context\":\"This Lifecycle pattern coordinates these distinct capability domains, ensuring that organizations achieve operational maturity sequentially and logically. For example, the Deployment Topology must reach the Baselined state before the Installation Configuration is permitted to enter the Executed state, explicitly preventing costly deployment rework. By observing the Pattern View Matrix, technology leaders can track the holistic health of the automation rollout, ensuring that security (RBAC) and scale (Mesh) mature in lockstep with the core infrastructure platform.\",\"narrativeElementName\":\"Lifecycle Phase\",\"seq\":2}],\"narrativeName\":\"The Complete Platform Adoption Journey\",\"narrativeTypeName\":\"Lifecycle\"}],\"patterns\":[{\"description\":\"The end-to-end orchestration of planning, installing, securing, and scaling the platform ecosystem.\",\"name\":\"AAP 2.6 Enterprise Adoption Lifecycle\",\"narrativeTypeName\":\"Lifecycle\",\"narratives\":[{\"description\":\"The sequential approach to deploying AAP 2.6 effectively.\",\"name\":\"Adoption Lifecycle Context\",\"narrativeContexts\":\"[Array]\",\"narrativeName\":\"Orchestrating the Entire Rollout\",\"narrativeTypeName\":\"Lifecycle\"}],\"patternViews\":[{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Securing enterprise subscriptions, evaluating basic workloads, and establishing a baseline understanding of capability needs.\",\"name\":\"Prerequisites Phase\",\"seq\":0},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Finalizing exhaustive system blueprints, provisioning the base RHEL host nodes, and finalizing the exact configurations to be injected.\",\"name\":\"Architecture and Preparation Phase\",\"seq\":1},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Executing the configuration-as-code installer playbooks and rigorously validating that core rootless container services are active.\",\"name\":\"Container Deployment Phase\",\"seq\":2},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Hardening access controls via the Gateway, integrating SSO, and deploying the initial layers of the automation mesh.\",\"name\":\"Governance and Day-2 Operations Phase\",\"seq\":3},{\"alphaStates\":\"[Array]\",\"description\":\"Reaching peak maturity by fully automating governance and verifying edge execution resilience.\",\"name\":\"Enterprise Scale Phase\",\"seq\":4}]}],\"personaGroups\":[],\"personas\":[],\"workProducts\":[]}"}
{"timestamp":"07:10:46.117","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"[extractPracticeNames] baseline: {\"activitySpaces\":[{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Initiated\"}],\"description\":\"Explore the possibilities presented by the creation of a new or improved platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Explore Possibilities\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Determined\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Value Established\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Viable\"}],\"description\":\"Conduct rigorous business analysis to quantify potential ROI, map platform capabilities to organizational value streams, and secure executive sponsorship.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Assess Business Value\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Addressed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Opportunity\",\"stateName\":\"Benefit Accrued\"}],\"description\":\"Track KPIs such as deployment frequency, MTTR, and developer adoption rates to proactively manage bottlenecks and prove continuous ROI.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Monitor Value Realization\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"stateName\":\"Allocated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"stateName\":\"Sustained\"}],\"description\":\"Define chargeback/showback models, right-size infrastructure, optimize costs through FinOps practices, and transition from CapEx to OpEx.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Manage Platform Economics\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Represented\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Involved\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"In Agreement\"}],\"description\":\"Conduct user research, utilize Jobs-to-be-Done frameworks, and ensure the platform demonstrates value through product management practices.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Engage Platform Consumers\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Satisfied for Deployment\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Stakeholders\",\"stateName\":\"Satisfied in Use\"}],\"description\":\"Provide internal marketing, create feedback loops, and deliver accessible support to ensure continuous voluntary adoption by stream-aligned teams.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Evangelize and Support\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"Leadership\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Assessed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Mitigated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"stateName\":\"Automated\"}],\"description\":\"Shift security left, embed Zero Trust principles, and codify compliance requirements into automated scanning tools to ensure secure-by-default platform operations.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Establish Secure Guardrails\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Bounded\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Coherent\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Acceptable\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Addressed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Requirements\",\"stateName\":\"Fulfilled\"}],\"description\":\"Distill stakeholder feedback into actionable requirements and define the Thinnest Viable Platform (TVP) to avoid over-engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Define Platform Capabilities\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Analysis\",\"Platform Strategic Alignment\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Architecture Selected\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Baselined\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Provisioned\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Ready\"}],\"description\":\"Establish declarative provisioning (IaC), build CI/CD pipelines, configure connectivity, deploy orchestration engines, and instantiate the six pillars of platform engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Architect and Build the Foundation\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Hosting Assets\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform\",\"stateName\":\"Evolving\"}],\"description\":\"Execute Day-2 operations using SRE practices, manage observability telemetry, ensure high availability, and continuously evolve the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Operate and Evolve the System\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Site Reliability\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Scoped\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Available\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Self Service\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"stateName\":\"Optimized\"}],\"description\":\"Build Internal Developer Portals (IDPs), intuitive CLIs, and automated scaffolding templates to drastically reduce cognitive load and enable autonomous self-service.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Develop the Golden Paths\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Analysis\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Specified\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Provisioned\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Integrated\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Asset\",\"stateName\":\"Operational\"}],\"description\":\"Specify, acquire, and securely integrate individual platform assets ensuring seamless interoperability with established Golden Paths.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Integrate Toolchain Services\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Engineering\",\"Site Reliability\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Prepared\"}],\"description\":\"Prepare to do the work required for the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Prepare To Do The Work\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\",\"Leadership\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Started\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Under Control\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Concluded\"}],\"description\":\"Manage agile delivery cycles, allocate engineering capacity, and track velocity to ensure predictable platform feature development.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Coordinate Delivery Sprints\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Formed\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Collaborating\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Team\",\"stateName\":\"Performing\"}],\"description\":\"Define clear team interaction modes, establish X-as-a-Service boundaries, and continuously assess cognitive load using Team Topologies principles.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Structure Organizational Topologies\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Leadership\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"Foundation Established\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"In Use\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"In Place\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Way Of Working\",\"stateName\":\"Working Well\"}],\"description\":\"Define incident response procedures, institute blameless post-mortems, standardize CI methodologies, and foster a continuous-learning culture.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Establish Operational Practices\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Site Reliability\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Governance\",\"stateName\":\"Documented\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Platform Governance\",\"stateName\":\"Audited\"}],\"description\":\"Translate manual governance rules into automated, machine-readable policies that execute within deployment pipelines without impeding velocity.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Implement Policy-as-Code\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"Engineering\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Strategized\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Enabled\"},{\"alphaName\":\"Organizational Change\",\"stateName\":\"Embedded\"}],\"description\":\"Execute formal change management programs, upskill engineering talent, address behavioral resistance, and facilitate the shift to product-driven platform engineering.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Drive Cultural Transformation\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Leadership\",\"Management\"]},{\"contributesTo\":[{\"alphaName\":\"Work\",\"stateName\":\"Closed\"}],\"description\":\"Stop the work and close out the endeavor.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Stop The Work\",\"requiredCompetencies\":[\"Management\"]}],\"alphas\":[{\"description\":\"The foundational business drivers dictating the platform transformation.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Opportunity\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The desire to adopt a platform is identified.\",\"name\":\"Initiated\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The value and parameters of the platform are quantified.\",\"name\":\"Determined\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform's value is accepted by sponsors.\",\"name\":\"Value Established\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The business case demonstrates a viable return.\",\"name\":\"Viable\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The opportunity is actively being addressed by the platform.\",\"name\":\"Addressed\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The expected benefits are being consistently realized.\",\"name\":\"Benefit Accrued\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The financial and outcome-based justification and accounting for the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Platform Value And Economics\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Financial needs and potential values are recognized.\",\"name\":\"Modeled\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Costs and benefits are logically modeled.\",\"name\":\"Allocated\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The economic model is approved.\",\"name\":\"Sustained\",\"seq\":3}]},{\"description\":\"The individuals, groups, or organizations affected by, or able to affect, the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Stakeholders\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Key stakeholders are identified.\",\"name\":\"Recognized\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholder representatives are designated.\",\"name\":\"Represented\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders actively participate.\",\"name\":\"Involved\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholder expectations are aligned.\",\"name\":\"In Agreement\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders approve deployment.\",\"name\":\"Satisfied for Deployment\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders are satisfied with the operational platform.\",\"name\":\"Satisfied in Use\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The capabilities, features, and constraints the platform must satisfy.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Requirements\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The need for a specific asset is identified.\",\"name\":\"Conceived\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The scope of the requirements is defined.\",\"name\":\"Bounded\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Requirements are clear, consistent, and logical.\",\"name\":\"Coherent\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Stakeholders agree the requirements meet their needs.\",\"name\":\"Acceptable\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform satisfies the established requirements.\",\"name\":\"Addressed\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"All requirements are successfully delivered and operational.\",\"name\":\"Fulfilled\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The unified system of assets and interfaces provided to consumers.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Platform\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The foundational structure is chosen.\",\"name\":\"Architecture Selected\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Core capabilities are established.\",\"name\":\"Baselined\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform can be consumed.\",\"name\":\"Provisioned\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform is fully operational.\",\"name\":\"Ready\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform is actively supporting workloads.\",\"name\":\"Hosting Assets\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The platform is decommissioned.\",\"name\":\"Evolving\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The means by which consumers interact with and consume platform assets.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Platform Consumption Interface\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The desired interface is conceptualized.\",\"name\":\"Envisioned\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Interface capabilities are defined.\",\"name\":\"Scoped\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The interface is accessible.\",\"name\":\"Available\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Consumers can independently use the interface.\",\"name\":\"Self Service\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The interface provides a frictionless experience.\",\"name\":\"Optimized\",\"seq\":5}]},{\"description\":\"The individual services, tools, or resources that constitute the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Solution\",\"name\":\"Platform Asset\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The need for a specific asset is identified.\",\"name\":\"Identified\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Asset requirements are detailed.\",\"name\":\"Specified\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset is created or acquired.\",\"name\":\"Provisioned\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset works within the broader platform.\",\"name\":\"Integrated\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset is in active use.\",\"name\":\"Operational\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The asset is decommissioned.\",\"name\":\"Value Yielding\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The activities required to build, operate, and maintain the platform.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Work\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is requested.\",\"name\":\"Initiated\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is ready to begin.\",\"name\":\"Prepared\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is in progress.\",\"name\":\"Started\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is proceeding predictably.\",\"name\":\"Under Control\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Work is finished.\",\"name\":\"Concluded\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"All work activities are officially complete.\",\"name\":\"Closed\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"The group of individuals responsible for the platform's success.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Team\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Initial team members are identified.\",\"name\":\"Seeded\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The team structure is established.\",\"name\":\"Formed\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Team members work together effectively.\",\"name\":\"Collaborating\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The team consistently delivers value.\",\"name\":\"Performing\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The team is disbanded or repurposed.\",\"name\":\"Adjourned\",\"seq\":5}]},{\"description\":\"The tailored set of practices, tools, operational workflows, and industry alignments used by a team.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Way Of Working\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The principles, constraints, and baseline industry alignments are established.\",\"name\":\"Principles Established\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The key practices, workflow models, and logical definitions are selected.\",\"name\":\"Foundation Established\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Team members are using behavioral walkthroughs to adapt to the way-of-working.\",\"name\":\"In Use\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The practices are fully integrated into daily activities.\",\"name\":\"In Place\",\"seq\":4},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The way of working is highly efficient, automated, and demonstrably successful.\",\"name\":\"Working Well\",\"seq\":5},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The way of working is no longer needed.\",\"name\":\"Retired\",\"seq\":6}]},{\"description\":\"Automated controls, policies, and guardrails\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Platform Governance\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"The need for governance is recognized.\",\"name\":\"Scoped\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Initial policies are defined.\",\"name\":\"Documented\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Policies are actively applied.\",\"name\":\"Audited\",\"seq\":3}]},{\"description\":\"Measures the business risk evaluation, security posture validation, and compliance mitigation maturity.\",\"focusName\":\"Value\",\"name\":\"Platform Risk And Compliance\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Basic security risks and compliance needs are listed.\",\"name\":\"Identified\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Detailed risk assessment matrices and compliance mappings are documented.\",\"name\":\"Assessed\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Scenario-based behavioral guides mitigate specific user risks.\",\"name\":\"Mitigated\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Automated compliance auditing and security posture checks are in place.\",\"name\":\"Automated\",\"seq\":4}]},{\"description\":\"The organizational patterns, business rationale, and change management required to support the platform transformation.\",\"focusName\":\"Endeavor\",\"name\":\"Organizational Change\",\"states\":[{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Rationale for change is identified.\",\"name\":\"Recognized\",\"seq\":1},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Change plans and communication pathways are mapped.\",\"name\":\"Strategized\",\"seq\":2},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Playbooks addressing behavioral pushback are executed.\",\"name\":\"Enabled\",\"seq\":3},{\"checklist\":[],\"description\":\"Comprehensive change management toolkits and automated feedback surveys are deployed.\",\"name\":\"Embedded\",\"seq\":4}]}],\"authors\":[\"Kernel Authors\"],\"competencies\":[{\"description\":\"The ability to understand needs, assess options, and make informed decisions.\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Analysis\",\"description\":\"Fundamental awareness\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Analysis\",\"description\":\"Applies in simple contexts\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Analysis\",\"description\":\"Applies in most contexts\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Analysis\",\"description\":\"Adapts to complex contexts\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Analysis\",\"description\":\"Extends to new contexts\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Analysis\"},{\"description\":\"The ability to design, build, and implement technical solutions.\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Fundamental awareness\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Applies in simple contexts\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Applies in most contexts\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Adapts to complex contexts\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Engineering\",\"description\":\"Extends to new contexts\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Engineering\"},{\"description\":\"The ability to inspire, guide, and motivate a team.\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":\"Fundamental awareness\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":\"Applies in simple contexts\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":\"Applies in most contexts\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":\"Adapts to complex contexts\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Leadership\",\"description\":\"Extends to new contexts\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Leadership\"},{\"description\":\"The ability to plan, organize, and coordinate work.\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Management\",\"description\":\"Fundamental awareness\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Management\",\"description\":\"Applies in simple contexts\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Management\",\"description\":\"Applies in most contexts\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Management\",\"description\":\"Adapts to complex contexts\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Management\",\"description\":\"Extends to new contexts\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Management\"},{\"description\":\"The ability to design, implement, and automate security policies, access controls, and compliance checks within the platform.\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"description\":\"Understands basic security principles and compliance requirements.\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"description\":\"Can configure basic security settings and access controls based on documented procedures.\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"description\":\"Can independently design and implement comprehensive security architectures and automate compliance auditing.\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"description\":\"Can adapt security strategies to address novel threats and complex, multi-cloud environments.\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\",\"description\":\"Develops new paradigms for platform security and proactive threat hunting.\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Platform Security And Compliance Enforcement\"},{\"description\":\"The ability to align platform capabilities and roadmap with broader business goals, economic models, and enterprise architecture.\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"description\":\"Understands the high-level business drivers for the platform.\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"description\":\"Can articulate how specific platform features support identified business opportunities.\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"description\":\"Can develop and manage platform roadmaps that demonstrably drive business value and ROI.\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"description\":\"Can pivot platform strategy in response to shifting market conditions or major organizational changes.\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Platform Strategic Alignment\",\"description\":\"Pioneers new platform business models or economic strategies that redefine enterprise value.\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Platform Strategic Alignment\"},{\"description\":\"The ability to apply software engineering principles to operations, ensuring platform reliability, scalability, and performance (SRE).\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Site Reliability\",\"description\":\"Understands the concepts of SLIs, SLOs, and basic incident response.\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Site Reliability\",\"description\":\"Can participate in incident response and implement basic monitoring alerts.\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Site Reliability\",\"description\":\"Can independently design robust monitoring systems, define effective SLOs, and lead complex incident resolutions.\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Site Reliability\",\"description\":\"Can architect highly resilient, self-healing systems and establish enterprise-wide SRE practices.\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Site Reliability\",\"description\":\"Develops novel approaches to chaos engineering or predictive reliability modeling.\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Site Reliability\"},{\"description\":\"The ability to gather, communicate, and balance the needs of other stakeholders, and accurately represent their views.\",\"levels\":[{\"competencyName\":\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"description\":\"Fundamental awareness and understanding of representation concepts.\",\"level\":1,\"name\":\"Basic\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"description\":\"Can apply representation concepts in simple contexts.\",\"level\":2,\"name\":\"Applies\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"description\":\"Can apply representation concepts in most contexts without supervision.\",\"level\":3,\"name\":\"Masters\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"description\":\"Can apply judgment and adapt representation techniques to complex contexts.\",\"level\":4,\"name\":\"Adapts\"},{\"competencyName\":\"Stakeholder Representation\",\"description\":\"Recognized expert, able to extend representation concepts to new contexts.\",\"level\":5,\"name\":\"Innovating\"}],\"name\":\"Stakeholder Representation\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-25T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"The Platform Adoption Kernel establishes the universal foundation for platform transformations, organized into the three Areas of Concern.\",\"focuses\":[{\"description\":\"Focuses on business justification, financial management, and organizational alignment.\",\"name\":\"Value\"},{\"description\":\"Encapsulates the design, provisioning, optimization, and the hosted items running on the platform foundation.\",\"name\":\"Solution\"},{\"description\":\"Governs the execution of the transformation, encompassing people, processes, and policies.\",\"name\":\"Endeavor\"}],\"keywords\":[\"platform\",\"adoption\",\"kernel\"],\"name\":\"Platform Adoption Essentials\",\"narrativeTypes\":[{\"description\":\"Enforces a strict cause-and-effect relationship between context and outcomes (Situation, Task, Action, Result).\",\"name\":\"The STAR Format\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"The context or background of the challenge.\",\"howToUse\":\"Describe the specific situation, context, or baseline state before action is taken.\",\"name\":\"Situation\"},{\"description\":\"The specific challenge, objective, or requirement.\",\"howToUse\":\"Outline the specific task, problem, or goal that needs to be addressed.\",\"name\":\"Task\"},{\"description\":\"The specific steps or interventions performed.\",\"howToUse\":\"Detail the methodology, activities, or steps taken to address the task.\",\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"description\":\"The outcome, impact, or value achieved.\",\"howToUse\":\"Summarize the measurable results, outcomes, or state changes achieved from the actions.\",\"name\":\"Result\"}]},{\"description\":\"Highly effective for macro-level lifecycle orchestrations (platform adoptions, transformations).\",\"name\":\"The Hero's Journey\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"The starting point before the transformation.\",\"howToUse\":\"Describe the current, pre-platform state of the organization.\",\"name\":\"The Ordinary World\"},{\"description\":\"The catalyst for change.\",\"howToUse\":\"Outline the business opportunity, crisis, or driver that necessitates the platform transformation.\",\"name\":\"The Call to Adventure\"},{\"description\":\"The core transformation challenges and execution.\",\"howToUse\":\"Detail the complex adoption activities, migrations, and challenges faced during implementation.\",\"name\":\"The Ordeal\"},{\"description\":\"The new operational baseline and realized value.\",\"howToUse\":\"Describe the successful adoption, the accrual of benefits, and the new optimized way of working.\",\"name\":\"The Return\"}]},{\"description\":\"Positions the consumer as the Hero and the Platform Engineering team as the Guide utilizing the defined approach.\",\"name\":\"The Three-Act Structure & StoryBrand\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"Identifying the consumer and their pain points.\",\"howToUse\":\"Identify the primary consumer (the Hero) and detail the specific friction or problem they face.\",\"name\":\"Act I: The Hero and the Problem\"},{\"description\":\"The platform team offers a solution.\",\"howToUse\":\"Introduce the Platform Engineering team as the Guide who provides a clear, paved-path approach or plan.\",\"name\":\"Act II: The Guide and the Plan\"},{\"description\":\"Execution and outcome.\",\"howToUse\":\"Describe the call to action for the consumer to adopt the plan, and the successful outcome of doing so.\",\"name\":\"Act III: Call to Action and Success\"}]},{\"description\":\"Shorter frameworks (And/But/Therefore) designed for rapid, highly persuasive daily execution updates.\",\"name\":\"Micro-Narratives (ABT)\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"The current situation and baseline facts.\",\"howToUse\":\"State the current agreed-upon context, background, and baseline facts.\",\"name\":\"And (Context)\"},{\"description\":\"The problem, challenge, or contradiction.\",\"howToUse\":\"Introduce the specific problem, blocker, challenge, or contradiction encountered.\",\"name\":\"But (Conflict)\"},{\"description\":\"The action taken or conclusion reached.\",\"howToUse\":\"State the specific action taken, decision made, or conclusion reached to resolve the conflict.\",\"name\":\"Therefore (Resolution)\"}]},{\"description\":\"A brief, informal explanation of a software feature written from the perspective of the end user.\",\"name\":\"User story\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"This identifies the specific persona or role interacting with the feature. It avoids the generic term **the user** to provide context on their technical ability, permissions, and needs.\",\"howToUse\":\"Use this to define constraints. Instead of saying \\\"user,\\\" say \\\"First-time Visitor\\\" or \\\"System Administrator.\\\" This helps the developers understand if the UI should be \\\"idiot-proof\\\" or \\\"power-user focused.\\\"\",\"name\":\"As a [role]\"},{\"description\":\"This is the intent or the feature itself. It describes the action the user wants to take within the software.\",\"howToUse\":\"Keep this focused on the **what,** not the **how.** Avoid mentioning specific UI elements like **click a red button.** Focus on the functional capability you are giving them.\",\"name\":\"I wan to [perform some action]\"},{\"description\":\"This is the purpose. It explains the underlying problem the user is trying to solve or the value they hope to gain.\",\"howToUse\":\"Use this to justify the work. If you can’t find a compelling **So that** statement, the feature might not be worth building. It also helps developers suggest better technical solutions if they understand the ultimate goal.\",\"name\":\"So that [I can achieve some goal]\"}]},{\"description\":\"A well-structured Epic provides a \\\"north star\\\" for the team, ensuring everyone knows why a large project exists and what success looks like.\",\"name\":\"Epic\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"A clear, punchy title and a one-sentence elevator pitch that describes the high-level initiative.\",\"howToUse\":\"Treat this as the project's identity. Use it in stakeholder meetings and roadmap views to provide an instant understanding of what is being built without getting bogged down in details.\",\"name\":\"Summary\"},{\"description\":\"This section explains how this Epic aligns with the company's broader business goals or quarterly objectives (OKRs).\",\"howToUse\":\"Use this to justify the budget and resource allocation. If you can't link the Epic back to a specific business value (e.g., \\\"Increasing retention by 10%\\\"), it shouldn't be an Epic.\",\"name\":\"Strategic Intent\"},{\"description\":\"A list of the primary and secondary users who will be impacted by this large-scale change.\",\"howToUse\":\"Use this to keep the scope focused. When brainstorming features, ask: \\\"Does this specific feature serve the personas listed in the Epic?\\\" If not, it belongs in a different Epic.\",\"name\":\"User Personas\"},{\"description\":\"These are not detailed stories yet, but rather the broad capabilities the system must have once the Epic is finished.\",\"howToUse\":\"Use these as \\\"themes\\\" to help you brainstorm the individual User Stories later. They serve as the framework for your backlog.\",\"name\":\"High-Level Requirements\"},{\"description\":\"The quantitative data points that will prove the Epic was a success after it is released.\",\"howToUse\":\"Use this to define the \\\"Definition of Done\\\" for the entire project. Instead of saying \\\"when the code is finished,\\\" use \\\"when the checkout conversion rate hits 5%.\\\"\",\"name\":\"Success Metrics\"}]},{\"description\":\"A standard lifecycle orchestration framework to map progression phases.\",\"name\":\"Lifecycle\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"Conditions required before starting the lifecycle.\",\"howToUse\":\"Define the Phase 0 or preparation steps, including baseline checks or prerequisite states, that must be achieved before the main lifecycle begins.\",\"name\":\"Prerequisites\"},{\"description\":\"An active stage of lifecycle execution.\",\"howToUse\":\"Detail the active state transitions, required work products, and activities for this specific phase of the lifecycle progression.\",\"name\":\"Lifecycle Phase\"}]},{\"description\":\"A cohesive narrative format that guides the reader carefully through the evidence for and against a proposition before reaching a conclusion.\",\"name\":\"Essay Narrative\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"The start of the essay used to contextualise the work and grab the attention of the reader.\",\"howToUse\":\"Explain how the topic sits within the framework of the subject area as a whole. Outline the structure of your essay very briefly, but do not give your conclusions away on the first page.\",\"name\":\"Introduction\"},{\"description\":\"A section establishing the interpretation of central concepts without relying on dictionary definitions.\",\"howToUse\":\"Relate in your own words how the terms you will be using are to be interpreted within the context of your essay.\",\"name\":\"Defining Key Concepts\"},{\"description\":\"The core discussion where secondary works are evaluated and viewpoints are balanced against each other.\",\"howToUse\":\"Be selective in your choice of evidence and use signposting language to guide your reader. Quote sparingly, paraphrase occasionally, and summarise often to integrate other people's ideas into your own argument.\",\"name\":\"Presenting Evidence\"},{\"description\":\"The closing section that synthesises the presented evidence and forms a direct response to the assignment title.\",\"howToUse\":\"Draw the threads of your argument together. Do not bring in new evidence in your concluding paragraphs or try to cram in ideas that you have not developed fully.\",\"name\":\"Conclusion\"}]},{\"description\":\"A formal, informative structure broken down into sections and sub-sections to order and communicate relevant information in an easily navigable way.\",\"name\":\"Report Narrative\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"A stand-alone summary of the entire report's purpose, methodology, findings, conclusions, and recommendations.\",\"howToUse\":\"This should be the last thing that you write. Keep it concise (usually a paragraph or two and always less than a page) to enable the reader to make an informed decision about whether they want to read the report itself.\",\"name\":\"Executive Summary\"},{\"description\":\"Explains the rationale for undertaking the work reported on, the background, and the scope of the report.\",\"howToUse\":\"State what the report is about, define how it meets the requirements of the brief, and explain your research methods.\",\"name\":\"Introduction\"},{\"description\":\"A clear description of how the investigation was carried out and why specific methods were chosen.\",\"howToUse\":\"Write this section concisely but thoroughly. Provide step-by-step details in such a way that a reader could replicate the research you have done.\",\"name\":\"Methods\"},{\"description\":\"A purely factual presentation of the research data using text, graphs, tables, or diagrams.\",\"howToUse\":\"Present the findings of your research as simply as possible. Save your interpretation of the results for the Discussion section.\",\"name\":\"Results and Findings\"},{\"description\":\"The section that brings everything together by showing how the findings relate to the purpose of the report and previous research.\",\"howToUse\":\"Interpret the results, showing how they respond to the brief explained in the introduction. Mention if there were any problems or unexpected results and how they were solved.\",\"name\":\"Discussion\"},{\"description\":\"Suggestions for a future course of action based on the evidence and conclusions.\",\"howToUse\":\"Make recommendations that solve problems or help to develop a new strategy. Make an effort to sound authoritative and certain in your choices.\",\"name\":\"Recommendations\"}]},{\"description\":\"The structural elements required for a reference list entry.\",\"name\":\"Citation Standard\",\"narrativeElements\":[{\"description\":\"The person, group, or organization responsible for the work.\",\"howToUse\":\"Invert authors' names (Lastname, F. M.). Use an ampersand (&) before the final author's name in a list. For groups, use the full name.\",\"name\":\"Author\"},{\"description\":\"The publication date of the work.\",\"howToUse\":\"Enclose the year in parentheses, followed by a period: (2026). For works with no date, use (n.d.).\",\"name\":\"Date\"},{\"description\":\"The name of the specific work being cited.\",\"howToUse\":\"Italicize the title of standalone works (books, reports). Use sentence case—capitalize only the first word of the title and subtitle.\",\"name\":\"Title\"},{\"description\":\"Where the work can be retrieved, such as a journal, publisher, or URL.\",\"howToUse\":\"Include the periodical title and volume/issue if applicable. Provide a DOI or URL as a live link; do not include 'Retrieved from' for most entries.\",\"name\":\"Source\"}]}],\"updatedAt\":\"2023-10-25T00:00:00Z\",\"version\":\"1\"}"}
